ovino qualcosa di speciale...","tagline":"Alcuni segreti sono troppo grandi per essere tenuti nascosti."},{"language":"en-US","overview":"After being wrongfully convicted for stealing a pair of shoes, Stanley Yelnats is sent away to Camp Green Lake, a boys detention facility where inmates are forced to dig holes all day in the hot desert sun as a form of character building. As he endures the brutal routine, Stanley begins to uncover a hidden truth behind the camp, one that connects to a dangerous secret—and possibly Stanley’s family itself.","tagline":"Some secrets are too big to keep hidden."}],"images":{"logos":[],"posters":[],"backdrops":[]},"poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/4teBsh4YUjDu9EKvX8NvrzpsqRj.jpg","background":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/cVMK2k0Wbs8DV3IK5sS4ziVenrI.jpg","seasons":[],"schema":{}}},"artworkLibrary":{"tmdb":{"schemaVersion":1,"source":"tmdb","id":8326,"type":"movie","originalLanguage":"en-US","series":{"poster":{"it":{"status":"available","selected":{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/4teBsh4YUjDu9EKvX8NvrzpsqRj.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/4teBsh4YUjDu9EKvX8NvrzpsqRj.jpg","language":"it","width":800,"height":1200},"candidates":[{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/4teBsh4YUjDu9EKvX8NvrzpsqRj.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/4teBsh4YUjDu9EKvX8NvrzpsqRj.jpg","language":"it","width":800,"height":1200},{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/y3dE43foY2HzOuPzoeU8DnPmyqT.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/y3dE43foY2HzOuPzoeU8DnPmyqT.jpg","language":"it","width":2000,"height":3000},{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/g7FRRgyymfAqlkXgtMzFGCLvYfB.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/g7FRRgyymfAqlkXgtMzFGCLvYfB.jpg","language":"it","width":2000,"height":3000}]},"en":{"status":"available","selected":{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/o2Dm2mcE1qW8